# This file keeps the versions directory in git
# Migration files will be stored here when using Alembic
# Since we're using raw SQL, this folder is for future use
# and for storing custom migration scripts if needed.

# If you want to use versioned migrations:
# 1. Create SQL files in the parent directory with pattern V{version}__{description}.sql
# 2. The migration manager will automatically detect and apply them

# Example:
#   V1__initial_schema.sql
#   V2__add_product_tables.sql
#   V3__create_sales_tables.sql